      <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)" source="#source-756-3077"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-759-774"><rb>唐</rb><rt>たう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-774-777">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-777-807"><rb>貞觀</rb><rt>ぢやうくわん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-807-810">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-810-825"><rb>頃</rb><rt>ころ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-825-831">だと</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-831-843"><rb>云</rb><rt>い</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-843-855">ふから、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-855-879"><rb>西洋</rb><rt>せいやう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-879-885">は七</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-885-909"><rb>世紀</rb><rt>せいき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-909-912">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-912-930"><rb>初</rb><rt>はじめ</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-930-951"><rb>日本</rb><rt>にほん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-951-954">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-954-978"><rb>年號</rb><rt>ねんがう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-978-981">と</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-981-993"><rb>云</rb><rt>い</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-993-1014">ふもののやつと</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1014-1038"><rb>出來掛</rb><rt>できか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1038-1047">かつた</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1047-1062"><rb>時</rb><rt>とき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1062-1074">である。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1074-1107"><rb>閭丘胤</rb><rt>りよきういん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1107-1110">と</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1110-1122"><rb>云</rb><rt>い</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1122-1125">ふ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1125-1149"><rb>官吏</rb><rt>くわんり</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1149-1176">がゐたさうである。</seg><rub